Cell["\<\
Uses CompiledFunctionTools`CompilePrint and checks whether its printed \
representation contains \"MainEvaluate\". Load CompiledFunctionTools` before \
calling it.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->392156813,ExpressionUUID->"5682be48-6e1d-e448-9f76-2cbe8f74cc92"],

Cell["\<\
Echoes and returns a diagnostic string containing True or False. The embedded \
Boolean reports whether this string-based check found no MainEvaluate call; \
it is not a proof of numerical correctness or performance.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1931041933,ExpressionUUID->"3ca69b35-d896-7144-9934-3d3a7739e6ea"]
}, Closed]],

